  "summary": "Malicious code in pistolo (npm)",
  "details": "Pistolo@1.0.0 is a casino-promotion package that advertises the gambling site casino-pistolo[.]cz. It ships a minimal 3-file package with no repository and no declared functionality beyond promoting the casino destination. The package is part of a broader pattern of gambling-spam packages that reference casino/betting sites in their metadata. No executable payload or network exfiltration was identified in the package metadata; the malicious character is the deceptive casino-promotion spam distribution.",
